    id: "20260723-003",
    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "重大事件",
    title: "瑞士鐵路巨擘 Stadler Rail 遭駭客 Everest 竊取技術資料，公司拒付贖金並提告",
    summary: "全球鐵道車輛跨國製造商 Stadler Rail 近期公告，其遭到駭客組織 Everest 竊取資訊及勒索。駭客於七月中透過入侵資料交換平臺，竊取了 Stadler 的特定技術資料，並要求支付高額贖金。Stadler 方面強調，外洩的資料僅為供應商提供的技術資訊，與公司安全無關，且沒有任何相關個資被竊走。公司進一步聲明，其資訊系統並未受影響，資料外洩事件不會影響全球使用的鐵道車輛，公司生產營運亦維持正常運作。Stadler 堅決表示不會支付贖金，並已向當地警局提出刑事控告。根據報導，Everest 組織從勒索軟體服務轉型為竊取資料後公開外洩以索償，但 Stadler 未說明是否遭到檔案加密。",
    tags: ["Stadler Rail", "Everest", "勒索攻擊", "技術資料外洩", "供應鏈安全", "鐵路產業"],
    title_en: "Swiss Rail Giant Stadler Rail Targeted by Hackers Everest, Technical Data Stolen; Company Refuses Ransom and Files Lawsuit",
    summary_en: "Global rail vehicle manufacturer Stadler Rail recently announced that it was targeted by the hacking group Everest for data theft and ransomware. The hackers infiltrated a data exchange platform in mid-July, stealing specific technical data belonging to Stadler and demanding a large ransom. Stadler emphasized that the leaked data consisted only of technical information provided by suppliers, and was unrelated to the company's security, stating that no personal data was stolen. The company further declared that its information systems were unaffected, and the data leak would not impact the global use of its rail vehicles, maintaining normal production and operations. Stadler firmly stated that it would not pay the ransom and has filed a criminal complaint with local police. According to reports, the Everest group transitioned from a ransomware service to data theft followed by public leakage for extortion, but Stadler did not specify whether its files were encrypted.",
    tags_en: ["Stadler Rail", "Everest", "Ransomware Attack", "Technical Data Leakage", "Supply Chain Security", "Rail Industry"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/177577", lang: "ZH-TW" }
    ]
