    summary: "Apple 在 iOS 27 中為 Messages 應用程式帶來多項重大功能升級。核心亮點包括整合 Apple Intelligence 提供的「一鍵建議」，能根據對話內容自動提供提醒或圖片搜尋等協助，提升用戶效率。此外，Messages App 增加了全新的「繪圖」功能，預示著未來可能支援的摺疊式 iPhone 體驗。對於使用 RCS 協定與 Android 朋友通訊的用戶，iOS 27 升級了多項體驗：支援行內回覆（In-line replies）和標準化的 Tapback 反應，讓體驗更接近 iMessage。此外，標準也納入了編輯和撤回訊息的能力。其他優化包括：提供關閉音訊按鈕的設定選項、整合多重 Tapback 通知、以及讓智慧回覆建議更貼近個人寫作風格。整體而言，這些更新旨在提升訊息傳遞的便利性、跨平台體驗的一致性，並強化系統的穩定性與性能。",
    tags: ["iOS 27", "Messages", "Apple Intelligence", "RCS", "iMessage", "繪圖功能"],
    title_en: "iOS 27 Messages App Major Upgrade: Featuring Apple Intelligence Suggestions, Drawing Capabilities, and RCS Message Enhancements",
    summary_en: "Apple is bringing several major feature upgrades to the Messages application in iOS 27. Key highlights include the integration of Apple Intelligence's \"one-tap suggestions,\" which can automatically provide assistance such as reminders or image searches based on conversation content, thereby improving user efficiency. Furthermore, the Messages App introduces a brand new \"drawing\" feature, hinting at future support for foldable iPhone experiences. For users communicating with Android friends using the RCS protocol, iOS 27 enhances multiple aspects of the experience: it supports in-line replies and standardized Tapback reactions, making the experience closer to iMessage. Additionally, the standard now includes the ability to edit and recall messages. Other optimizations include: providing a setting option to mute audio buttons, integrating multiple Tapback notifications, and making smart reply suggestions more aligned with personal writing style. Overall, these updates aim to enhance the convenience of message delivery, the consistency of cross-platform experience, and strengthen system stability and performance.",
