    title: "SmartGym iPhone App 更新：提升運動紀錄與調整效率，新增整合式日誌與智能動作按鈕",
    summary: "SmartGym 應用程式發布了更新版本，主要針對運動訓練的紀錄與調整流程進行優化。本次更新最大的亮點是將原先僅在 Apple Watch 上提供的靈活性，延伸至 iPhone 應用程式。用戶現在可以在新的「整合式日誌」（Inline Logging）介面中，無需離開當前畫面即可調整、紀錄或新增訓練組數。此外，系統還加入了顯示原計畫組數的指示標記，幫助用戶在訓練過程中更好地掌握進度。新版還引入了全新的鍵盤設計，提供快速增減值和切換訓練組類型（如常規、熱身、遞減組）的按鈕。更重要的是，更新優化了「智能動作按鈕」（Smart Action Button），使其能更精準地預測用戶當前的動作狀態（如完成一組、轉移到下一個運動或恢復訓練），並自動顯示最相關的動作選項，極大地提升了使用體驗。用戶甚至可以將 iPhone 的實體動作按鈕配置為觸發此功能，進一步簡化操作流程。此更新旨在讓用戶將更多時間用於訓練本身，而非操作介面。",
    tags: ["SmartGym", "iPhone", "Apple Watch", "iOS", "App Store", "用戶體驗"],
    title_en: "SmartGym iPhone App Update: Enhancing Workout Tracking and Adjusting Efficiency with Integrated Logging and Smart Action Button",
    summary_en: "The SmartGym application has released an updated version, primarily focusing on optimizing the workout training tracking and adjustment workflow. The biggest highlight of this update is extending the flexibility previously available only on the Apple Watch to the iPhone application. Users can now adjust, record, or add training sets within the new \"Inline Logging\" interface without leaving the current screen. Furthermore, the system has added an indicator that displays the original planned set count, helping users better track their progress during the workout. The new version also introduces a completely redesigned keyboard, providing buttons for quick increment/decrement of values and switching between training set types (such as regular, warm-up, or drop sets). Crucially, the update optimizes the \"Smart Action Button,\" allowing it to more accurately predict the user's current action status (such as completing a set, transitioning to the next exercise, or resuming training) and automatically display the most relevant action options, greatly enhancing the user experience. Users can even configure the iPhone's physical action button to trigger this function, further simplifying the workflow. This update aims to allow users to spend more time on the training itself, rather than on the operational interface.",
