    summary: "三星宣布大幅延長其最新款 Galaxy Watch 9 和 Galaxy Watch Ultra 2 的支援壽命。這兩款智慧手錶將獲得長達五年的 Wear OS 主要系統升級和安全補丁，比以往的四年更長，甚至超過了 Google Pixel Watch 系列僅三年的支援期。這項更新涵蓋完整的 Wear OS 升級，確保使用者在未來五年內都能獲得系統功能更新與安全修補。此外，這兩款手錶都預裝了 Wear OS 7，是首批搭載該作業系統的產品。雖然文章指出使用者可能不會這麼頻繁地更換手錶，但延長的支援期為用戶提供了更穩定的使用保障。這項政策的改變，顯示了三星在智慧穿戴裝置生態系統中，提升產品長期可靠性的策略。",
    tags: ["Samsung", "Galaxy Watch 9", "Wear OS", "Galaxy Watch Ultra 2", "Android", "安全更新"],
    title_en: "Samsung extends support lifespan: Galaxy Watch 9 and Watch Ultra 2 to receive five years of Wear OS updates and security patches",
    summary_en: "Samsung has announced a significant extension of the support lifespan for its latest Galaxy Watch 9 and Galaxy Watch Ultra 2. These two smartwatches will receive up to five years of Wear OS major system upgrades and security patches, extending beyond the previous four years and even surpassing the three-year support period of the Google Pixel Watch series. This update covers complete Wear OS upgrades, ensuring users receive both system feature updates and security patches for the next five years. Furthermore, both watches are pre-loaded with Wear OS 7, making them among the first products to feature this operating system. Although the article notes that users may not frequently replace their watches, the extended support period provides users with more stable usage assurance. This policy change demonstrates Samsung's strategy of enhancing long-term reliability within the smart wearable device ecosystem.",
