    summary_en: "This article reviews the experience of Samsung integrating Gemini Intelligence into the Galaxy Z Fold 8 for the first time. This feature expands upon existing App Automation, allowing it to automate operations across more than 40 applications, such as booking flight tickets or hotels. Users can initiate Gemini via voice or by long-pressing the power button and issue task commands. The review points out that Gemini's automation capability is more 'activated' when the command includes precise qualifiers like dates or times. Although the feature can execute tasks automatically without prior confirmation and provides real-time feedback of 'processing,' the reviewer found the process to be time-consuming and lacking detailed human intervention control over critical parameters (such as exact flight times or preferred airlines), suggesting that it is currently in a Beta phase and its practical utility needs improvement.",
