    summary_en: "OpenAI's system status page confirms that some users are encountering abnormal 'high error rate' issues when using ChatGPT and Codex. This incident has persisted for approximately four hours, affecting a subset of users. OpenAI stated that mitigation measures were implemented two hours ago, and they are currently monitoring the system's recovery status. Although reports from external monitoring sites (such as DownDetector) show a declining trend, some users continue to report persistent issues via social media. OpenAI is continuously monitoring the situation and will provide updates when the service disruption is resolved or more details become available. This incident is classified as a service availability issue, and specific technical details or patches have not been publicly disclosed. Users should pay attention to official OpenAI announcements and avoid over-relying on the service's immediate availability.",
    tags_en: ["OpenAI", "ChatGPT", "Codex", "Service Outage", "System Status", "AI Service"],
