    title: "AMD發布ROCm.AI：利用AI自動優化AI工作負載，提升開發者在ROCm上的編程效率",
    summary: "AMD在年度AI發展日宣布了ROCm.AI平台，旨在為開發者提供一個由人工智慧驅動的解決方案，以優化和適應各種工作負載在ROCm上的運行。ROCm.AI將在八月發布，並建立在ROCm 7.14之後的最新版本中。該平台整合了Hyperloom組件，能夠自動化端到端推論工作負載的優化，協助分析、核心優化和驗證，大幅縮短人工優化所需的時間。ROCm.AI利用AI能力優化計算核心、記憶體管理、平行化和排程，以提升AI推論和訓練的性能。AMD宣稱，ROCm.AI相較於ROCm 7.0基線，可提供平均3.3倍的推論提升和2.4倍的訓練提升。此功能旨在讓主流AI代理（如Claude、Codex、Gemini等）成為「ROCm超級用戶」，協助開發者更高效地將程式碼適應AMD的AI堆疊。",
    tags: ["AMD", "ROCm", "AI", "Hyperloom", "AI優化", "開發工具鏈", "AI工作負載"],
    title_en: "AMD Releases ROCm.AI: Utilizing AI to Automatically Optimize AI Workloads and Enhance Developer Coding Efficiency on ROCm",
    summary_en: "At its annual AI Development Day, AMD announced the ROCm.AI platform, an AI-driven solution designed to help developers optimize and adapt various workloads running on ROCm. ROCm.AI will be released in August, built upon the latest version after ROCm 7.14. The platform integrates the Hyperloom component, which automates end-to-end inference workload optimization by assisting with analysis, core optimization, and validation, significantly reducing the time required for manual optimization. ROCm.AI utilizes AI capabilities to optimize compute cores, memory management, parallelization, and scheduling, thereby boosting the performance of AI inference and training. AMD claims that ROCm.AI can provide an average 3.3x inference boost and 2.4x training boost compared to the ROCm 7.0 baseline. This feature aims to make major AI agents (such as Claude, Codex, Gemini, etc.) 'ROCm super-users,' helping developers more efficiently adapt code to the AMD AI stack.",
    tags_en: ["AMD", "ROCm", "AI", "Hyperloom", "AI Optimization", "Development Toolchain", "AI Workload"],
